# Reconnaissance / information gathering -- all CLI.
#
# Web content-discovery/fuzzing tools (gobuster, ffuf, wfuzz, dirb,
# feroxbuster, whatweb) moved out of here to web.list.chroot -- they're
# web-specific, not general network/host recon, and were originally
# miscategorized when this list was first populated from Kali's
# kali-linux-headless dependency list.

nmap
masscan
amass
theharvester
recon-ng
dnsenum
dnsrecon
fierce
sublist3r
whois
smbclient
smbmap
enum4linux
nbtscan
onesixtyone
snmp
ldap-utils
p0f

